<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets warrants on Guangdong Inv.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on Guangdong Inv.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Tuesday it is issuing 600 million American style call warrants on shares of Guangdong Investment Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$6.16	PREMIUM	 13.86 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1298    GEARING	 5.05X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  27.NOV.97    MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p>SPOT PRICE	  HK$6.55</p>
<p> NOTE		  GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
